<title>JAPAN: TSE says to open homepage on Monday.</title>
<headline>TSE says to open homepage on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that it would open its home page on the Internet next Monday on a trial basis.</p>
<p>The home page will show the movement of the TOPIX index and other indices, a TSE official said.</p>
<p>It will also provide information on listed companies and member securities houses of the exchange and various rules of the TSE but it will not provide movements in prices of individual listed companies, he said.</p>
<p>The home page will be available at http://www.tse.or.jp/.</p>
</text>
